  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the cat hiding behind the chair",
  "description": "The user (the meme creator) is explicitly projected onto the cat hiding behind the chair in the bottom panel. This projection is established by the text 'me wondering what this dude's problem is', where 'me' directly refers to the user. The cat visually embodies this 'me' as a figure of confusion or dismissiveness, creating a semiotic link between the textual deictic and the visual material. The user is thus projected onto the visual entity of the cat.",
